      "title": "WHO position paper on influenza vaccines",
      "url": "https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/who-wer9940-456-488",
      "snippet": "In its Weekly Epidemiological Record, WHO states that annual influenza vaccination is the most effective measure for preventing influenza and reducing severe outcomes in high-risk groups. The paper highlights adults 65 years and older, pregnant women, young children, and people with chronic conditions as priority groups for seasonal vaccination.",
